FG-L1-6b0ea79346 || cls=CD mod=MUST_NOT dom=WF rel=PE pol=GOV-019~ conf=M || actor=agent; act=never discard, overwrite, reset, clean, stash away or destroy user work to make a Git operation easier; trig=Git operation; scope=git-workflow skill; exc=none; time=during Git; enf=text || test=GOV-019 lacks stash away. Stashing to switch branch is recoverable, GOV-019 does not forbid it, and this does. But the purpose clause to make an operation easier remains: a stash the user asked for is not done to ease an operation for the agent, so the reported restriction on a requested stash is not clear.
